# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Perry environment template
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` and fill in values.
#
# Perry is configured for SUBSCRIPTION-ONLY mode by default. The agent
# framework routes only to local Ollama models OR your existing Claude
# Pro/Max + Gemini CLI subscriptions. There are NO per-token LLM API
# costs in this stack.
#
# Most secrets below are migrated into the encrypted vault on first boot.
# After bootstrap you can remove them from this file — the dashboard
# Secrets panel becomes the source of truth.
#
# Order: lower-numbered sections are required for a working install.
# Higher-numbered sections are optional features.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1. Master keys (cannot be in vault — chicken-and-egg) ───────────────────
# The master encryption key for the secrets vault itself. Use a random hex
# string (32+ bytes). If lost, every encrypted secret is unrecoverable.
PERRY_VAULT_KEY=

# Dashboard Bearer auth. Gates /api/*. Once Perry boots once and copies
# this into the vault, you can remove it from here. Use a random hex string.
PERRY_API_KEY=

# ── 2. Subscription/CLI auth (NOT secrets — managed by the CLIs themselves) ─
# Claude Pro/Max:    ran `claude login` once on host. Auth in ~/.claude/
# Gemini Advanced:   ran `gemini login` once on host. Auth in ~/.gemini/
#
# Perry NEVER reads these files. The CLI workers run with these mounted
# at spawn time. If you set OPENAI / ANTHROPIC API keys here, Perry's
# subscription-only mode IGNORES them — agents block routing to metered
# APIs by design.

# ── 3. Optional external data sources (migrated to vault on first boot) ─────
# Inbound webhooks (HMAC signature check). Required only if external
# services post events to /api/system/webhooks/*.
PERRY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Reddit OAuth for book-research mining. Without these, Reddit falls
# back to proxy-pool routing (see VPN section below).
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
REDDIT_USER_AGENT=perry-bookbot/1.0 by /u/your_handle

# Google Books API. 1000 queries/day free. Powers Source 6 in book-research.
# Restricted to Books API in Google Cloud Console.
GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=

# ── 4. Network routing (optional — falls back to direct IP if empty) ────────
# Single proxy URL for all Reddit fetches.
REDDIT_PROXY=
# Round-robin pool of proxies for Reddit. Comma-separated. Takes precedence
# over REDDIT_PROXY when set. Comment out the default if you don't have a
# VPN — Perry routes direct to the host IP, which works for most queries.
REDDIT_PROXY_POOL=
AMAZON_PROXY_POOL=

# ── 5. Cloudflare tunnel (optional — remote dashboard access) ───────────────
CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_TOKEN=

# ── 6. VPN: TorGuard WireGuard (optional, only if using TorGuard) ───────────
# UK exit (used by gluetun-torguard-uk service if defined in compose).
TG_WG_UK_ENDPOINT_IP=
TG_WG_UK_ENDPOINT_PORT=
TG_WG_UK_PRIVATE_KEY=
TG_WG_UK_PUBLIC_KEY=
TG_WG_UK_ADDRESSES=
TG_WG_UK_MTU=1390
# US exit.
TG_WG_US_ENDPOINT_IP=
TG_WG_US_ENDPOINT_PORT=
TG_WG_US_PRIVATE_KEY=
TG_WG_US_PUBLIC_KEY=
TG_WG_US_ADDRESSES=
TG_WG_US_MTU=1390

# ── 7. VPN: NordVPN WireGuard (legacy gluetun-uk/de/us containers) ──────────
NORDVPN_WG_PRIVATE_KEY=

# ── 8. Local agent LoRA (optional — set when you've trained one) ────────────
# When Perry trains its own tool-using LoRA from accumulated trajectory data
# (see "Subscription-only mode" + "Agent foundation" memory entries),
# point here so the perry-agent provider slot picks it up.
# OLLAMA_PERRY_AGENT_MODEL=perry-code-agent:v1
# OLLAMA_PERRY_AGENT_BASE_URL=http://ollama-embeddings:11434
